# No Lua at all. The client names a SavedVariables file after the addon
# folder that declares it, never after the variable, so anything the player stored would land
# in Spoken.lua beside its settings. This folder exists only so the file a player is told
# to upload is named for what it holds. Gather.lua in the player reads and writes the table.
